    <!--EN: desc->This [writingQualityAdjective] [bookType] [follows] a [chef] as [protagHe] [storyStruggles]. [writingQualitySentence]. [maybe_date]\n\nOnce read, this book will provide a new favourite ingredient or meal to the reader, and then it will be destroyed.-->
    <li>desc-&gt;此[writingQualityAdjective][bookType][follows]a[chef]为[protagHe][storyStruggles]。 [writingQualitySentence]。 [maybe_date]

一旦阅读，这本书将为读者提供一种新的最喜欢的食材或膳食，然后它将被销毁。</li>
