    <!--EN: storyStruggles->tries to give some insight into new, exciting ingredients-->
    <li>storyStruggles-&gt;尝试深入了解新的、令人兴奋的成分</li>
    <!--EN: storyStruggles->aims to explore the world of bold, innovative ingredients-->
    <li>storyStruggles-&gt;旨在探索大胆创新成分的世界</li>
    <!--EN: storyStruggles->delves into the discovery of fresh and thrilling flavours-->
    <li>storyStruggles-&gt;深入探索新鲜刺激的口味</li>
    <!--EN: storyStruggles->seeks to uncover the secrets of unique and exotic ingredients-->
    <li>storyStruggles-&gt;试图揭开独特和异国成分的秘密</li>
    <!--EN: storyStruggles->offers a peek into the realm of vibrant, unfamiliar ingredients-->
    <li>storyStruggles-&gt;让您一睹充满活力、陌生成分的领域</li>
    <!--EN: storyStruggles->takes a deep dive into discovering exciting, novel ingredients-->
    <li>storyStruggles-&gt;深入探索令人兴奋的新颖成分</li>
    <!--EN: storyStruggles->strives to illuminate the potential of new and adventurous ingredients-->
    <li>storyStruggles-&gt;努力揭示新的和冒险成分的潜力</li>
    <!--EN: storyStruggles->embarks on a journey to reveal the magic of undiscovered culinary gems-->
    <li>storyStruggles-&gt;踏上探索未被发现的烹饪宝石魔力的旅程</li>
    <!--EN: storyStruggles->provides a fresh perspective on using innovative and tantalizing ingredients-->
    <li>storyStruggles-&gt;提供了使用创新和诱人成分的全新视角</li>
    <!--EN: storyStruggles->ventures into the uncharted territory of intriguing, new ingredients-->
    <li>storyStruggles-&gt;冒险进入有趣的新成分的未知领域</li>
    <!--EN: storyStruggles->showcases the allure and versatility of bold, underexplored ingredients-->
    <li>storyStruggles-&gt;展示了大胆的、未被充分开发的成分的吸引力和多功能性</li>
    <!--EN: chef->chef-->
    <li>chef-&gt;厨师</li>
    <!--EN: chef->culinary artist-->
    <li>chef-&gt;烹饪艺术家</li>
    <!--EN: chef->gastronomer-->
    <li>chef-&gt;美食家</li>
    <!--EN: chef->head cook-->
    <li>chef-&gt;厨师长</li>
    <!--EN: chef->kitchen maestro-->
    <li>chef-&gt;厨房大师</li>
    <!--EN: chef->cuisine expert-->
    <li>chef-&gt;美食专家</li>
    <!--EN: chef->pastry chef-->
    <li>chef-&gt;糕点师</li>
    <!--EN: chef->sous chef-->
    <li>chef-&gt;副厨师长</li>
    <!--EN: chef->food specialist-->
    <li>chef-&gt;食品专家</li>
    <!--EN: chef->gourmet chef-->
    <li>chef-&gt;美食厨师</li>
    <!--EN: writingQualityAdjective(quality==6)->remarkably well-written-->
    <li>writingQualityAdjective(quality==6)-&gt;写得非常好</li>
    <!--EN: writingQualityAdjective(quality==5)->smart and insightful-->
    <li>writingQualityAdjective(quality==5)-&gt;聪明且富有洞察力</li>
    <!--EN: writingQualityAdjective(quality==4)->thoughtful and eloquent-->
    <li>writingQualityAdjective(quality==4)-&gt;深思熟虑、雄辩</li>
    <!--EN: writingQualityAdjective(quality==3)->well-written-->
    <li>writingQualityAdjective(quality==3)-&gt;写得好</li>
    <!--EN: writingQualityAdjective(quality==2)->mediocre-->
    <li>writingQualityAdjective(quality==2)-&gt;平庸</li>
    <!--EN: writingQualityAdjective(quality==1)->poorly-written-->
    <li>writingQualityAdjective(quality==1)-&gt;写得不好</li>
    <!--EN: writingQualityAdjective(quality==0)->nearly-incoherent-->
    <li>writingQualityAdjective(quality==0)-&gt;几乎不连贯</li>
    <!--EN: writingQualitySentence(quality[greater_than]4)->It is [excellentDesc] [excellentExtra]-->
    <li>writingQualitySentence(quality[greater_than]4)-&gt;是[excellentDesc] [excellentExtra]</li>
    <!--EN: writingQualitySentence(quality[less_than]5,quality[greater_than]1)->It is [decentDesc] [decentExtra]-->
    <li>writingQualitySentence(quality[less_than]5,quality[greater_than]1)-&gt;是[decentDesc] [decentExtra]</li>
    <!--EN: writingQualitySentence(quality[less_than]2)->It is [awfulDesc] [awfulExtra]-->
    <li>writingQualitySentence(quality[less_than]2)-&gt;是[awfulDesc] [awfulExtra]</li>
    <!--EN: excellentDesc->a thoughtful exploration of the culinary spirit-->
    <li>excellentDesc-&gt;对烹饪精神的深思熟虑的探索</li>
    <!--EN: excellentDesc->deeply insightful about the complexity of cooking-->
    <li>excellentDesc-&gt;对烹饪的复杂性有深刻的洞察</li>
    <!--EN: excellentDesc->tightly-written and rich with exotic creations-->
    <li>excellentDesc-&gt;文笔严谨，充满异域风情</li>
    <!--EN: excellentDesc->creative and original-->
    <li>excellentDesc-&gt;创意且原创</li>
    <!--EN: excellentDesc->wildly original and remarkably well-crafted-->
    <li>excellentDesc-&gt;原创且制作精良</li>
    <!--EN: excellentDesc->filled with relatable humorous kitchen anecdotes-->
    <li>excellentDesc-&gt;充满了相关的幽默厨房轶事</li>
    <!--EN: excellentExtra->. Each recipe's description flows naturally into the next-->
    <li>excellentExtra-&gt;。每个菜谱的描述自然地融入到下一个菜谱中</li>
    <!--EN: excellentExtra->. It is a page-turner and very hard to put down, each recipe better than the previous one-->
    <li>excellentExtra-&gt;。这是一本引人入胜的书，让人爱不释手，每个菜谱都比前一个更好</li>
    <!--EN: excellentExtra->. Its recipes constantly blow the reader's mind-->
    <li>excellentExtra-&gt;。它的食谱不断地让读者大吃一惊</li>
    <!--EN: decentDesc->a decent dish collection-->
    <li>decentDesc-&gt;不错的菜肴收藏</li>
    <!--EN: decentDesc->interesting and engaging, with neat culinary ideas-->
    <li>decentDesc-&gt;有趣且引人入胜，还有巧妙的烹饪创意</li>
    <!--EN: decentDesc->focused on one interesting culinary technique-->
    <li>decentDesc-&gt;专注于一种有趣的烹饪技术</li>
    <!--EN: decentDesc->somewhat humorous from time to time-->
    <li>decentDesc-&gt;时不时有点幽默</li>
    <!--EN: decentDesc->appealing to a certain type of cook-->
    <li>decentDesc-&gt;吸引某种类型的厨师</li>
    <!--EN: decentExtra-> but has some awful cooking omissions-->
    <li>decentExtra-&gt; 但有一些可怕的烹饪遗漏</li>
    <!--EN: decentExtra-> but its recipes are often hard to follow-->
    <li>decentExtra-&gt; 但它的食谱通常很难遵循</li>
    <!--EN: decentExtra-> but is riddled with cooking errors-->
    <li>decentExtra-&gt; 但充满了烹饪错误</li>
    <!--EN: decentExtra-> but lacks any deep complexity to its recipes-->
    <li>decentExtra-&gt; 但其配方缺乏深度复杂性</li>
    <!--EN: decentExtra-> but the recipes are trite and simplistic-->
    <li>decentExtra-&gt; 但食谱陈腐且简单</li>
    <!--EN: decentExtra-> but the author constantly uses words inappropriately in an attempt to sound smart-->
    <li>decentExtra-&gt; 但作者不断使用不恰当的词语，试图显得聪明</li>
    <!--EN: decentExtra-> but there is a huge text wall detailing the author's inane travel experiences before each recipe. Just give us the recipe!-->
    <li>decentExtra-&gt;但是在每个食谱之前都有一面巨大的文字墙详细介绍了作者愚蠢的旅行经历。只要给我们食谱！</li>
    <!--EN: decentExtra-> but the writing is excessively flowery-->
    <li>decentExtra-&gt;但是文笔太华丽了</li>
    <!--EN: decentExtra-> but many of the ingredients on its recipes are unnecessary and add nothing to their flavours-->
    <li>decentExtra-&gt;但其食谱中的许多成分都是不必要的，并且不会添加任何味道</li>
    <!--EN: awfulDesc->very poorly written, as if created by an amateur chef,-->
    <li>awfulDesc-&gt;写得很差，好像是业余厨师写的，</li>
    <!--EN: awfulDesc->written by someone who should never work in a kitchen-->
    <li>awfulDesc-&gt;由不应该在厨房工作的人撰写</li>
    <!--EN: awfulDesc->full of irrelevant anecdotes that add nothing to the dish being described-->
    <li>awfulDesc-&gt;充满了不相关的轶事，对所描述的菜肴没有任何帮助</li>
    <!--EN: awfulDesc->hard to follow-->
    <li>awfulDesc-&gt;难以理解</li>
    <!--EN: awfulDesc->lacking in engaging dishes-->
    <li>awfulDesc-&gt;缺乏吸引人的菜肴</li>
    <!--EN: awfulDesc->presenting very bizarre dishes, yet unoriginal-->
    <li>awfulDesc-&gt;呈现非常奇怪的菜肴，但非原创</li>
    <!--EN: awfulDesc->far, far too long, filled with redundant recipes-->
    <li>awfulDesc-&gt;太长了，充满了多余的食谱</li>
    <!--EN: awfulExtra-> and the recipes are borderline incoherent-->
    <li>awfulExtra-&gt; 和菜谱几乎不连贯</li>
    <!--EN: awfulExtra-> and the recipes are extremely hard to follow-->
    <li>awfulExtra-&gt; 而且食谱非常难以遵循</li>
    <!--EN: awfulExtra-> and some of the recipes sound like they would outright kill you-->
    <li>awfulExtra-&gt; 和一些食谱听起来像是会彻底杀死你</li>
    <!--EN: awfulExtra-> and the recipes lack any sense of theme or meaning-->
    <li>awfulExtra-&gt; 和食谱缺乏任何主题感或意义</li>
    <!--EN: awfulExtra-> and its recipes don't present any interesting ideas at all-->
    <li>awfulExtra-&gt; 及其食谱根本没有提出任何有趣的想法</li>
    <!--EN: awfulExtra-> and its recipes are bland and tasteless-->
    <li>awfulExtra-&gt;及其食谱平淡无味</li>
    <!--EN: awfulExtra-> and by the looks of it it's basically a guide to getting food poisoning-->
    <li>awfulExtra-&gt; 从表面上看，它基本上是食物中毒的指南</li>
    <!--EN: awfulExtra-> and it tends to substitute ingredients for lower-quality alternatives-->
    <li>awfulExtra-&gt; 并且它倾向于用低质量的替代品来替代成分</li>
    <!--EN: maybe_date->-->
    <li>maybe_date-&gt;</li>
